DTSTAMP:20260727T041139Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52977097536220
DTSTART:20260712T230000Z
DTEND:20260713T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip at 7:00 p.m.\n\nRegistration requi
 red by July 9.Trip fee is $15 per person.Limited to 10 people. Restricted 
 to ages 16 and up. All participants must have at least 2 hours of prior pa
 ddling experience OR have completed one of our Beginner Kayaking workshops
 .Bring your own canoe/kayak\, or rent a sit-on-top kayak (weight limit: 27
 5 pounds) for an additional $20.Location: Pinegrove SRA\n\nExplore the qui
 eter side of Monroe Lake during these guided paddling trips that journey t
 hrough backwaters\, wetlands\, bays\, and/or slow-moving streams. Trips hi
 ghlight beautiful views\, hidden wildlife\, aquatic plants\, and unique la
 nd features. Find your new favorite place to kayak! 2 hours \n\n \n\nREFUN
 D/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistrations are considered final and n
 o refunds or date transfers are available\, with limited exceptions. You m
 ay transfer a registration(s) to another person(s) by contacting Jill Vanc
 e at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email used in your original registrat
 ion. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of the person to whom you want to tr
 ansfer the registration(s). Requests must be received at least 48 hours pr
 ior to the start of the workshop.In the event that the trip is cancelled b
 y the instructor for weather\, low registration\, or instructor illness\, 
 registered participants may opt to transfer their registration to another 
 Explore Monroe trip on a different date or receive a full refund. Weather 
 Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is anticipated\, the trip will lik
 ely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there is a strong possibility (as d
 etermined by the instructor) of moderate to heavy rain\, high winds\, or t
 hunder/lightning\, the workshop will be cancelled for safety reasons. Any 
 decision to cancel due to anticipated weather will be made at least 2 hour
 s prior to the trip start time. In the event of a cancellation\, an email 
 notice will be sent to all registrants.Low Registration Policy: The trip m
 ay be cancelled\, at the discretion of the instructor\, if there are fewer
  than 3 people signed up by the registration deadline. If the trip is canc
 elled due to low registration\, all participants will be notified within 2
 4 hours of the close of registration.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Pinegrove State Recreation Area (directions emailed 
 to registrants prior to trip)
SUMMARY:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip\, Pinegrove SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/explore-monroe-paddling-trip-pine
 grove-sra-monroe-lake-1480
CATEGORIES:Events
