UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53311964875302
DTSTART:20260811T223000Z
DTEND:20260811T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip at 6:30 p.m.\n\nRegistration requi
 red by August 8.Trip fee is $15 per person.Limited to 10 people. Restricte
 d to ages 16 and up. All participants must have at least 2 hours of prior 
 paddling experience OR have completed one of our Beginner Kayaking worksho
 ps.Bring your own canoe/kayak\, or rent a sit-on-top kayak (weight limit: 
 275 pounds) for an additional $20.Location: Crooked Creek SRA\n\nExplore t
 he quieter side of Monroe Lake during these guided paddling trips that jou
 rney through backwaters\, wetlands\, bays\, and/or slow-moving streams. Tr
 ips highlight beautiful views\, hidden wildlife\, aquatic plants\, and uni
 que land features. Find your new favorite place to kayak! 2 hours \n\n \n\
 nREFUND/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistrations are considered final
  and no refunds or date transfers are available\, with limited exceptions.
  You may transfer a registration(s) to another person(s) by contacting Jil
 l Vance at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email used in your original reg
 istration. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of the person to whom you want
  to transfer the registration(s). Requests must be received at least 48 ho
 urs prior to the start of the workshop.In the event that the trip is cance
 lled by the instructor for weather\, low registration\, or instructor illn
 ess\, registered participants may opt to transfer their registration to an
 other Explore Monroe trip on a different date or receive a full refund. We
 ather Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is anticipated\, the trip wi
 ll likely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there is a strong possibility
  (as determined by the instructor) of moderate to heavy rain\, high winds\
 , or thunder/lightning\, the workshop will be cancelled for safety reasons
 . Any decision to cancel due to anticipated weather will be made at least 
 2 hours prior to the trip start time. In the event of a cancellation\, an 
 email notice will be sent to all registrants.Low Registration Policy: The 
 trip may be cancelled\, at the discretion of the instructor\, if there are
  fewer than 3 people signed up by the registration deadline. If the trip i
 s cancelled due to low registration\, all participants will be notified wi
 thin 24 hours of the close of registration.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Crooked Creek State Recreation Area (directions emai
 led to registrants prior to trip)
SUMMARY:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip\, Crooked Creek SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/explore-monroe-paddling-trip-croo
 ked-creek-sra-monroe-lake-8465
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
