DESCRIPTION:“Junk” Journaling Workshop at 4:00 p.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Ac
 tivity Center: Shelter\n\n•    This 60-min. workshop is most appropriate
  for adults and older children.\n•    Workshop fee is $2 per person. Spa
 ce is limited to 12 people. \n•    Sign up in advance at the Activity Ce
 nter on Fri. from 1 to 5 p.m. or Sat. from 1 to 3:30 p.m.\n\nJunk journali
 ng is a creative and sustainable approach to creating a unique journal fro
 m personal memorabilia and found objects. The technique encourages self-ex
 pression\, storytelling\, and imagination\, without fear of “messing up.
 ” We’ll guide you in creating and decorating a starter journal and off
 er tips on how to expand and develop it.
