UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53516271967026
DTSTART:20260922T220000Z
DTEND:20260922T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip at 6:00 p.m.\n\nRegistration requi
 red by September 19.Trip fee is $15 per person.Limited to 10 people. Restr
 icted to ages 16 and up. All participants must have at least 2 hours of pr
 ior paddling experience OR have completed one of our Beginner Kayaking wor
 kshops.Bring your own canoe/kayak\, or rent a sit-on-top kayak (weight lim
 it: 275 pounds) for an additional $20.Location: Cartop SRA\n\nExplore the 
 quieter side of Monroe Lake during these guided paddling trips that journe
 y through backwaters\, wetlands\, bays\, and/or slow-moving streams. Trips
  highlight beautiful views\, hidden wildlife\, aquatic plants\, and unique
  land features. Find your new favorite place to kayak! 2 hours \n\n \n\nRE
 FUND/TRANSFER/CANCELLATION POLICY\n\nRegistrations are considered final an
 d no refunds or date transfers are available\, with limited exceptions. Yo
 u may transfer a registration(s) to another person(s) by contacting Jill V
 ance at jvance@dnr.IN.gov from the same email used in your original regist
 ration. Provide the name(s) and email(s) of the person to whom you want to
  transfer the registration(s). Requests must be received at least 48 hours
  prior to the start of the workshop.In the event that the trip is cancelle
 d by the instructor for weather\, low registration\, or instructor illness
 \, registered participants may opt to transfer their registration to anoth
 er Explore Monroe trip on a different date or receive a full refund. Weath
 er Cancellation Policy: If only light rain is anticipated\, the trip will 
 likely proceed as scheduled. However\, if there is a strong possibility (a
 s determined by the instructor) of moderate to heavy rain\, high winds\, o
 r thunder/lightning\, the workshop will be cancelled for safety reasons. A
 ny decision to cancel due to anticipated weather will be made at least 2 h
 ours prior to the trip start time. In the event of a cancellation\, an ema
 il notice will be sent to all registrants.Low Registration Policy: The tri
 p may be cancelled\, at the discretion of the instructor\, if there are fe
 wer than 3 people signed up by the registration deadline. If the trip is c
 ancelled due to low registration\, all participants will be notified withi
 n 24 hours of the close of registration.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Cartop State Recreation Area\, Stipp Road\, Blooming
 ton\, IN
SUMMARY:Explore Monroe Paddling Trip\, Cartop SRA (Monroe Lake)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.in.gov/event/explore-monroe-paddling-trip-cart
 op-sra-monroe-lake-2671
CATEGORIES:Events
END:VEVENT
