DESCRIPTION:Stillwater Levee Walk at 1:00 p.m.\n\n•    Sign up at tinyurl
 .com/stillwater2026 by September 25.\n•    Limited to 20 people\, recomm
 ended for adults.\n•    Location: Meet at Northfork Check Station on Ken
 t Road\n\nJoin us for a hike along the levees of Stillwater Marsh to learn
  how Monroe Lake manages this area with wildlife in mind! We’ll explore 
 the crops planted for wildlife food\, check out the nesting boxes\, see wh
 ere (and how) the marsh gets flooded each year to create a seasonal wetlan
 d\, and explore the types of trees\, plants\, and animals that live here. 
 2 hours
