DESCRIPTION:Mummy Luminaries from 1 to 4:30 p.m.\nPaynetown SRA\, Activity 
 Center\n\n•    Cost is $5 per project (cash or check only).\n•    Supp
 lies are limited\; first-come first-served!\n•    Recommended for ages 8
  and up.\n\nDROP BY to make a Mummy Luminary - the perfect Halloween acces
 sory for your campsite picnic table\, patio table\, or fireplace mantle! W
 ith an eerie green glow and glow-in-the-dark eyes\, this quart-sized glass
  luminary is easy to assemble (and we’ll give you a green votive candle\
 , so you can use it right away). Craft takes 15 to 20 minutes to complete.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Activity Center
